  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0100_clerkm_01",
      "hash": "cd2960b82837a7d8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "噢！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是從真新鎮來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0100_clerkm_02",
      "hash": "cd2963b82837acf1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳認識大木博士吧？\\c\\n他拜託我把這個送去給他，\\n但我現在太忙走不開……\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能不能幫我\\n把這個交給大木博士呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0100_sys_01",
      "hash": "273c0ce0fcfa18e3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從店員那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]包裹[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0100_clerkm_03",
      "hash": "cd2962b82837ab3e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！\\n幫我向大木博士問好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0100_clerkm_04",
      "hash": "cd2965b82837b057",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0100_sys_02",
      "hash": "273c0de0fcfa1a96",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要立刻回研究所嗎？"
    }
  ],
